ntainer":null,"src":"api/label/18473","statements":[{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"DIRECTIONS: As a dietary supplement, on training days take one Pre-training Amplified Pak 30 minutes prior to your workout and one Post-training Recovery Pak immediately following your workout."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"In a study, a group of 25 participants exercised on the treadmill on two occasions. On one occasion, they used the Calorie Burn Blend in this formula 60 minutes before exercise and on the second occasion, they took a placebo. Results showed a 300% increase in calorie burn before exercise for those who took the Calorie Burn Blend compared to the placebo."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"CarnoSyn(TM)\nCarnosine Synthesizer"},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"CODE 825910 FMG"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"PRE-TRAINING AMPLIFIED PAK\nAmplified Muscle Igniter 4X"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Total caffeine per serving is 400 mg."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Conforms to USP <2091> for weight.\nMeets USP <2040> disintegration."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Natural Alternatives International (NAI) is the ownder of patents 5,695,596; 6,172,098; 6,426,361; 6,680,294 and registered trademark CarnoSyn(R)."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"resVida(R)\npromotes healthy aging"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"ResVida(R) is a registered trademark of DSM."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Capsimax(TM)\nCapsimax(TM) is a trademark of OmniActive Health Technologies."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"{QR code}\nSCAN & LEARN MORE"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"GNC QUALITY COMMITMENT\nGNC, the leader in the development and manufacture of dietary supplements, is committed to producing the highest quality product available. This commitment begins with quality designed supplement formulations. Every raw material that goes into a GNC supplement is guaranteed as to quality and potency. Each product is dated and then shipped immediately to our stores, so you can be sure you are purchasing the freshest supplements available. At GNC, we extend our quality commitment to you by offering our money-back guarantee.\nGNC GUARANTEE\nUse any GNC supplement for as little as 10 days. If you are not 100% completely satisfied, return the unused portion of the product with proof of purchase to your GNC store for a complete refund of your purchase price. No questions asked!"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary supplement"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"This cutting-edge training system contains new and improved ingredients necessary for optimal blood flow, oxygen and nutrient transportation, and maximum athletic performance. This AMPLIFIED system combines the power of creatine, nitric oxide, an intense thermogenic and breakthrough recovery support technology in one convenient system! Put the confusion of supplement timing to rest and get maximum workout results with the Amplified Pre-Post Training System.\n15 PRE-TRAINING PAKS"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"{image, 3 red tablets}\n3 Tablets\nAmplified Muscle Igniter 4X\nProvides a new and improved formula to take you through the full metabolic cycle of athletic performance and training to deliver serious results before, during and after exercise."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Pills shown not actual size."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"WARNING: Use only as directed. Do not exceed recommended daily intake. Do not use if pregnant, nursing or allergic to contraindicated to aspirin. If you are taking aspirin or blood thinning medication, under the age of 18 or have a medical condition consult your health care professional before using this product. Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery, or if upset stomach occurs."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NEW\nADVANCED MUSCLE PERFORMANCE\nMuscle performance boosting system"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"{circle} Pre-Post\n{circle man running} Endurance\n{circle flame} Energy\n{circle lightning} Power\n{circle heartbeat line} Recovery\n{beaker} Clinically Researched"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"ONE MONTH SUPPLY**\nPre-Training Amplified Pak {gray pill pack image}\nPost-Training Recovery Pak {red pill pack image}\n"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NEW, ADVANCED ULTIMATE MUSCLE PERFORMANCE AMPLIFYING SYSTEM\n{arrow} Features Pre-Workout Catalyst to Ignite Ultimate Physical & Mental Intensity\n{arrow} Efficiently Delivers More Nutrients & Oxygen to Power Through Fatigue Barriers\n{arrow} Powerful Amplified Creatine Formula Delivers a 400% Increase in Dose Efficiency for Enhanced Performance\n{arrow} Push Through Muscle Soreness with BioCore Enzymes & Support Recovery with MIcronized Glutamine"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Features Pro Performance(R) AMP products ideal to prepare your muscles for training and maximum performance!"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Take one pre-training pak 30 minutes prior to your workout."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"** Based on 15 workouts monthly."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No Artificial Flavors, No Dairy, Yeast Free."}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)","Dairy Free"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}